---

<section class="bg-black text-white py-12 px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-10">
      NAVIGATING THE INSURANCE <span class="text-primary">PROCESS</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="text-center text-2xl md:text-xl mb-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      Filing an insurance claim for roof damage can be a complex and confusing
      process. At Flash Roofing, we have the experience and knowledge to guide
      you through every step. Our team will assist you in the following ways:
    </p>

    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
      <!-- INSPECTION -->
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
        <iconify-icon
          icon="material-symbols:search"
          class="text-yellow-400 text-4xl mt-1"></iconify-icon>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase text-primary">Inspection</h3>
          <p class="text-justify text-2xl">
            Our experts will conduct a thorough inspection of your roof's
            damage, documenting all issues, from minor wear and tear to
            significant storm damage. We'll provide a detailed report that you
            can share with your insurance company.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- DOCUMENTATION -->
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
        <iconify-icon
          icon="mdi:file-document-edit"
          class="text-yellow-400 text-4xl mt-1"></iconify-icon>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase text-primary">
            Documentation
          </h3>
          <p class="text-justify text-2xl">
            We'll assist you in preparing all the necessary documentation,
            including photos and written reports, to support your claim. This
            documentation is crucial for a successful claim process.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CLAIM FILING -->
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
        <iconify-icon icon="mdi:file-send" class="text-yellow-400 text-4xl mt-1"
        ></iconify-icon>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase text-primary">
            Claim Filing
          </h3>
          <p class="text-justify text-2xl">
            We'll help you file the insurance claim with your provider, ensuring
            that all the essential information is included.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- NEGOTIATION -->
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
        <iconify-icon
          icon="mdi:scale-balance"
          class="text-yellow-400 text-4xl mt-1"></iconify-icon>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase text-primary">Negotiation</h3>
          <p class="text-justify text-2xl">
            Our experienced team will work with your insurance company to ensure
            that your claim is processed fairly and that you receive the
            coverage you're entitled to.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- REPAIRS AND RESTORATION -->
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
        <iconify-icon icon="mdi:tools" class="text-yellow-400 text-4xl mt-1"
        ></iconify-icon>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase text-primary">
            Repairs and Restoration
          </h3>
          <p class="text-justify text-2xl">
            Once your claim is approved, Flash Roofing will undertake the
            necessary repairs or replacement work promptly and efficiently,
            using high-quality materials and expert craftsmanship.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
